.TH CRUNCH_FACCESSAT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_faccessat \- Linux x86-64 syscall 269
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int crunch_faccessat(int directory, const char* path, int mode);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the original three-argument Linux faccessat syscall; flags are not supported.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR faccessat (2)
